= Tufts University School of Medicine - Prompt 05

#section_label("Prompt metadata")
- Title: Social Responsibility
- Limit: 1000 characters
- Cycle used in this repo: 2024 archive on Admit.org
- Source: https://med.admit.org/secondary-essays/tufts-university-school-of-medicine
